WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:13.320
Well, actually, I missed Amamiya-san's play.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.190
Riku-kun.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.880
All right. I've got to be brave tomorrow!

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:47.020
An Exciting School Trip

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.980
All right! It's lunchtime!

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.360
Excuse me.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.160
I'm coming in now.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:08.200
Board says: We're having our school trip now!! Wish you were here in Hokkaido!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:12.960
Board says: Watch out for bears!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.590
Hokkaido, eh?

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.050
That's so far away.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.170
Inbox

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.170
Aoba Riku

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.170
I'm going away for a while♪
I'll buy you a souvenir!

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:19.090
I'll buy you a souvenir!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.090
Yeah.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.090
Even though he's far away, I'll send him a message.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:30.560
Board says: We're having our school trip now!! Wish you were here in Hokkaido!  Watch out for bears!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:37.730
Tsumugino High School Class 2-A

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.740
What'll happen next?

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.580
Wow! We're in Hokkaido!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:50.450
Yeah. It's a little chilly, but I've always wanted to travel far away!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:51.290
Yeah.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:54.000
Book says: Hokkaido.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.000
Is this your first time in Hokkaido, Ayame?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:54.830
You could say that.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.500
Wow! I can't wait!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.340
Hey, hey, Sayuri.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.210
Where are you gonna go?

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.720
We've gotta see the clock tower, right?

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.010
We just got here. It's too early to make up our minds.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.970
We've gotta try this!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.970
Note: He circles Sapporo Ramen.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:10.730
Tada! We're having ramen for lunch!

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.060
You're so naive.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:17.110
Curry soup is more popular these days.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.610
Ramen!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.730
Curry soup!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:20.740
Ramen!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.950
Didn't I say that we'd be having crab?

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.240
Right, guys?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.570
Yes.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.950
They're always fighting like that.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.910
Hokkaido, eh?

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.040
It's been a while.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.170
Listen up.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:45.470
It's a school trip, but it's still part of your education.

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:46.640
Understand?

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.470
Yes!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.930
Oh! What's wrong, Tsukasa?

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.350
Oh, Mito-chan!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.810
I-It's nothing.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.270
Look! I'm fine!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:57.810
Oh, yeah.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.360
That's fine then.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.320
Okay. Let's have lunch together later.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.490
Y-Yeah.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.160
All right. Here I go.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.290
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:12.500
Isn't it?

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.250
I'll leave you behind!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.120
Hey, wait!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.290
This feels great!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.050
So, anyway, just when Botaru left for Tokyo...

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.470
Botaru!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.720
What's he doing?

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.550
I know! I know how you feel!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.680
Furano Make-Your-Own Ice Cream

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.330
What do you want?

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.500
Hey, hey.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.880
You're annoying.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.170
Geez.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:05.760
Got it!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.840
Look! It's huge!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.050
How's it going, Icchi?

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.680
I'm not getting a bite.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.600
What's wrong, Sayuri?

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.060
I don't know what to do.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.150
Amamiya-san.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.530
Um... Please let me borrow Haritora-san.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.530
Note: He's referring to the angry worm.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.530
O-Okay.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.160
Here you go.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:30.910
It should be all right now.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.740
Oh. You're quite good at this.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:36.620
Yeah.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.160
I used to live in Hokkaido, after all.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.920
I've fished here before.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.090
And then? And then?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.380
I caught a big one...

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:46.050
Aoba-kun.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.590
Riku-kuuun!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.800
You're so cool!

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.180
I knew you were destined to be my man!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.470
Hey, hey! Will you catch that really big fish for me?

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.680
If you can, then we'll cook it on a skewer!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.850
Oh no, that fish is just a legend!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:04.940
Icchi!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:05.770
Oh no.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.110
Sorry, Suzuki-kun.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.740
Riku-kun!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.990
This way! Over here!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.870
Wait up, Kasuga-san!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:29.590
Wow! There's a tree in a place like this!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.470
Here. Have some juice.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.640
O-Okay.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:33.760
Hey, now.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.510
Demon. Demon.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.510
Unforgivable!

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.600
Aojima really is a beautiful place!

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.400
Y-Yeah.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.570
Yeah. This really is Hokkaido, right, Sayuri?

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.400
Oh, Riku-kun! Let's check this out too!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.360
O-Okay.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:54.070
Sayuri?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.370
A-Ayame. Look. It's pretty over here too.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.620
Sayuri.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.880
Wow! It's as pretty as the peach trees!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.720
Y-Yeah, I guess so.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.840
I wonder if it's gonna snow.

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:16.220
It'd be even prettier if it snowed.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.930
But never mind that. Don't you have to go back to your own class?

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:23.020
Don't worry. I'll explain it to them later.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.980
I see.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.780
Geez. Aoba's so hopeless.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:34.240
Well, we're used to it now. His relationships are always like this.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.280
No kidding.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:36.530
I see.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.030
What's wrong, everyone?

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.620
The coffee here is great.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:46.920
Thank you so much!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.040
A-Amamiya-san!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.840
Um... well... actually... um...

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:53.840
Good for you.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:54.840
You get along so well with her.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:55.430
Huh?

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.180
Amamiya-san.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.320
How are things in Hokkaido?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:14.820
 How are things in
Hokkaido? I'm looking
forward to your
souvenir. ♪

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:14.820
Reply

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:14.820
Options

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.320
I'm looking forward to your souvenir.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:14.650
There we go.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:15.990
Send.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.250
Will he send me a reply soon?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.170
C'mon, Aoba-san.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.180
That was better than I thought it would be!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.560
It's like an offering to the gods.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:47.600
Oh yeah.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.100
I've gotta check my mobile.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.110
Hey! Amamiya went to the baths!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:55.650
And she went with Ayame, Yuukai, Sakura and Tsubaki!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.860
What did you say?!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.280
How dare you!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.200
What? A bath?

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.660
Don't say it, Aoba!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.120
Outdoor Baths

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.120
Women

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.120
Men

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.750
Hey, what are we gonna do with our free time the day after tomorrow?

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.300
We'll be in Sapporo, right?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.090
Isn't it obvious? Let's go to the clock tower and Oudori Park.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.340
The suburbs would be great too!

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.760
I don't care where we go as long as I can get good food.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.600
Then why don't you go with Icchi and the other boys?

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:25.810
Oh, sorry.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.270
I'll pass on that.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.690
Hey. Have you decided who to go with, Sayuri?

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.730
N-Not yet.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.650
You've gotta pick someone soon.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.780
Otherwise they'll choose for you.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.700
Uh, I don't know who to invite.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.410
Ayame! Sayuri!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.580
We'll see you in the bath!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.740
Okay!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.330
Don't space out like that.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.250
Now, then! Time for a bath!

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.750
Wait for me, Ayame!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.850
Time for a bath!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:05.890
Signs say: Don't leave your valuables behind!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.220
Ayame.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.270
Kasuga-san?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.020
A-Amamiya-san?

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.690
What's wrong? Did you hurt yourself?

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:15.270
No. I'm just a little tired.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.480
It's nothing.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.490
Well then, I'll see you later.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:19.990
Kasuga-san.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.570
Dinner! Dinner!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.030
Kasuga-san.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.130
You can't beat taking a bath!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.710
Why are you acting like an old lady?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.550
Glug, glug.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:46.810
We can look through the cracks, and no one can stop us.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.770
We shouldn't be doing this!

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.190
Cut it out, Icchi, Yuusuke!

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:52.020
Hey, Aoba!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.310
Look at that!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:55.690
Eros!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:55.690
Note: Eros is the Greek god of love.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.610
Hey, now. When did everyone make a pyramid?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.360
Hey, Aoba! Don't betray us!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.660
I'll switch places with you.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.580
Excuse us! Woof!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.910
Now this is paradise.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.380
See what I mean? It was Hiyoko.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.130
Dammit!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.920
Huh? What are the boys up to?

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.760
They've probably thought of something stupid again.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.930
They're such perverts.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.390
Y-You think so?

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.140
WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING?!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:33.890
Mother!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.860
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love. That's the way it is.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:39.820
Tokimeki.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.860
Memorial.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.900
Only Love.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.360
Okay. We're having lunch here.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:49.410
We'll be leaving at 12:30, so don't be late, all right?

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:58.750
We were on our knees all night, but our mission was a failure.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.090
Thanks to that, we didn't get a wink of sleep.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:12.060
That mission was a complete failure.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.100
Because I got mixed up in all that, I'm...

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:11.680
Huh?

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.440
Okay! Let's go check out the military museum tomorrow!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.650
All right. Let's have chanjayaki for lunch.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.690
Sounds good to me!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.650
Right, Ayame?

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:21.480
Yep.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:23.900
We should have enough time to see all of Sapporo!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.570
Okay! That settles it!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:26.860
That's right.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.530
We're free all day tomorrow.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.080
I wonder what Amamiya-san's gonna do.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.330
Hey, you'll come with us, right, Sayuri?

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:39.380
Sorry. I still haven't decided.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.840
What?

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.880
Amamiya-san hasn't made up her mind yet.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:46.430
Okay. Everyone's here, right?

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.180
Next stop, Sapporo!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:50.640
YEAH!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.600
Hey, you'll come with us, right, Sayuri?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:37.480
Sorry. I still haven't decided.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.730
What?

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.480
So that means...

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.440
She might go with me if I ask her.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:45.820
Okay!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:03.790
Yayoi Mizuna

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.340
Aoba-san.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.430
Did the batteries in his phone run down?

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.140
Amamiya-san.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.860
Hey, what about this?

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.440
Sounds good. It might be a secret place.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.780
Do you recommend any other places?

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.490
Let me see...

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.910
What about Mount Moyoi?

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:36.240
When I came here last time, I was with my family on vacation.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.660
The view at night is simply breathtaking.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.790
Really? I'm looking forward to it.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.750
Hey, look at that.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.340
I knew it.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:49.050
Somehow, those two really get along well.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.800
Amamiya-san's with Sakurai-kun.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.470
Hey, hey. What about this place?

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.930
Oh, that looks good! This is...

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.360
Not yet... Just a little more...

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:06.230
Uh?

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:07.610
Riku-kun!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:11.320
Riku-kun!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.160
Riku-kuuun!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:15.530
Kasuga-san!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:22.160
Hey, do you wanna spend your free time with me tomorrow?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:23.960
Well? It's okay, right?

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.790
Well...

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.970
Okay! It's almost time to go!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.180
We're almost out of time!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.680
I wonder where he went.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:43.850
Sa-yu-ri.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.270
A-Ayame.

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:46.270
Have you seen Aoba-kun?

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.440
Oh, Aoba-kun...

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.190
He went out with Kasuga-san, right?

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:52.690
I see.

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:53.650
Oh, my!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.870
Why are you looking for Aoba-kun, Sayuri?

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.700
I-It's nothing.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.160
O-Oh yeah.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.370
We just need to talk about something.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.670
Aoba used to live in Hokkaido.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:08.290
She's been researching all the recommended places in Hokkaido, so she can go there with him.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.090
That's what I've been saying.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:15.130
Okay, let's go see Clark-sensei!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:16.550
Y-Yes.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:17.430
Good idea.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:27.400
Sigh says: Otaru Station.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:27.400
Otaru! Otaru!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.330
Wow! It hasn't changed a bit!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.040
Huh? Have you been here before?

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:52.920
Yeah. When I was in middle school, my father worked nearby, so we lived here.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.590
Oh! Then you must know Sapporo like the back of your hand!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:56.760
Kinda.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.720
I see.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.100
C'mon. Tell me! Which places do you recommend?

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.100
C'mon!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.810
O-Okay.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.020
All right!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.480
I get to be alone with Riku-kun today!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.450
All right, I'll take your picture.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:19.160
Yes, sir!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.500
Oh, Riku-kun!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.630
My, what a lovely cafe!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:36.670
Yeah.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.470
It looks new.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.930
Oh, that's Otaru for you, I guess.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.470
Just like on TV.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:44.890
Ahhh!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.480
This raspberry sorbet is great!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.100
Are you all right?

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.860
You just had lunch.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:56.440
I've got a separate stomach for dessert!

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:59.030
Oh. I see, I see.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.990
Oh, excuse me. I'm going to the bathroom.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:03.450
All right. Have a good trip!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.120
Geez.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.330
This is so embarrassing!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.040
It's still all right.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.500
We're still a couple, aren't we?

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.760
Because I'm here with Riku-kun...

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:31.690
We've walked all over the place.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.310
Yeah.

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.610
I'm pretty tired.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:35.730
Are you all right?

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.320
Yeah. I'm just fine.

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.690
I guess so.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.110
You're always so energetic, Kasuga-san.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.950
Our free time is over.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:48.290
Yeah. We've gotta get back soon, or they'll get mad at us.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.580
I can't stand it. I still want to be alone with you.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.670
Kasuga-san?

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.090
Y-You know...

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.130
Riku-kun, do you...

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.640
Oh... it's snowing!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.180
It's snowing, Kasuga-san!

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.730
It's the first snow of the year!

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:11.520
Look!

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:15.520
Kasuga-san?

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:21.860
Kasuga-san!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.200
She's got a fever.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:26.620
Kasuga-san!

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:27.700
When did you start having a fever?

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.080
Sorry.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.210
I wanted to be with you for a little longer.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:35.670
I've had this for two days now.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.550
I thought I could endure it.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:39.630
Right?

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.800
Why?

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.220
You need some rest!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:46.890
But I wanted to go on the school trip with you.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.430
It looks like I messed up.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.100
Kasuga-san?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.180
Kasuga-san!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.100
I'm sorry.

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:55.940
I'm sorry, Riku-kun.

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:57.690
I'm so sorry.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:20:59.270
All right, I get it.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:00.780
You've done enough, so...

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:03.990
I'm sure there was a hospital around here...

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:05.990
I'm sorry.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.830
I'm so sorry, Riku-kun.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.950
Damn it!

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.880
Riku-kun!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:21.250
I'm sorry.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:22.800
I'm so sorry.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.680
I have to... I have to try a bit harder.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:28.970
Kasuga-san.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.720
They said that she should be okay now.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.480
If she rests until morning, she'll be fine.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.020
So we should go back, okay, Aoba-kun?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.900
No way!

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.770
I can't leave her here!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.150
Riku-kun.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:45.990
I'm sorry, Kasuga-san.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.570
I didn't know how you felt.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.990
If I'd realized...

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:55.750
Aoba-kun.

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:03.920
You have no new emails.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:07.090
Why hasn't he replied?

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:09.550
Aoba-san.

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:27.900
My heart is overflowing!

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:43.440
Even if I try to conceal my feelings for you,

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:48.980
I can't help blushing when our eyes meet.

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:57.890
I kept this a secret from my friends,

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:04.530
Because I didn't want to be teased.

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:13.780
The important thing that nobody knows,

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:21.240
I'll only tell to you.

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.370
These gently falling flower petals

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:29.030
are sneaking into my heart.

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:35.910
I want to make your heart flutter.

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:39.960
It's okay to have hopes

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:43.630
for the future we await, right?

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:49.940
My heart is overflowing!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.700
Next Episode Preview

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:53.490
It really was just a coincidence when we first met.

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:56.410
But my heart was pounding when I met you.

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:57.580
I wonder why.

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:02.290
It's probably because you told me that I had a wonderful dream.

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:05.070
And you smiled so kindly at me back then.

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:07.980
But now I'm getting more and more anxious.

00:24:08.630 --> 00:24:10.510
How long will this go on?

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:11.930
That's why I...

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:14.920
Next on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:16.430
An Exciting Message.

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:17.390
Please watch it.

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:19.380
Mina's memories are overflowing!

00:24:34.170 --> 00:24:40.190
Watch Tokimeki Memorial Next Week Too!
